msgstr ""
"토론 스레드를 요약하려면 라이선스가 필요합니다. 자세한 내용은 [라이선스 요구 "
"사항](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/configure/agents-"
"admin-guide.html#license-requirements)을 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/_generated/agents/docs/user_guide.md:112
msgid "To summarize a discussion thread:"
msgstr "토론 스레드를 요약하려면:"

#: ../../source/_generated/agents/docs/user_guide.md:114
msgid ""
"Hover over the first message in any [conversation "
"thread](https://docs.mattermost.com/collaborate/organize-"
"conversations.html)."
msgstr ""
"[대화 스레드](https://docs.mattermost.com/collaborate/organize-"
"conversations.html)의 첫 메시지에 마우스를 올립니다."

#: ../../source/_generated/agents/docs/user_guide.md:115
msgid "Select the **AI Actions** icon."
msgstr "**AI Actions** 아이콘을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/_generated/agents/docs/user_guide.md:116
msgid "Select **Summarize Thread**."
